# The largest decoration values: an underline of the most negative position
# and the largest thickness and a strike-out of the largest position and
# size, in a face of 16 units per em, at 256 pixels and at heights where the
# bands leave the range of 2^28 26.6 units in which they are kept.
family Triergon Decorations Extremes
units-per-em 16
metrics 13 -3
underline -32768 32767
strikeout 32767 32767
heights 16384 131072 262144
modes outlines
glyph advance 8
end
glyph advance 10 char 0x41
  contour 1 0, 1 11, 8 11, 8 0
end
glyph advance 4 char 0x20
end
